Version of HC Command Shell for Series3
---------------------------------------

PANSHLL.IMG is being made available to developers on an "as is" basis.
It is *not* a supported product.  Please do not ring Psion with questions
about Panshll.

On the other hand, any feedback about PANSHLL.IMG in the PSION 
conference on CIX will be read and questions may be answered.

See the documentation of the Command Shell in the HC Programming Guide 
in the C SDK for a list of the commands supported in general, plus some
additional comments.

Note incidentally that if you try to access the functionality of PANSHLL
using McLink on a PC, you *cannot* use the ! operator.  This is just
shorthand for
    RUN SYS$SHLL
but on the Series3, SYS$SHLL is of course a very different program.  Use
    RUN PANSHLL
instead.
